B.btD=new A.D("0.16.0","Tart\u0131mla vur: Tart\u0131m penceresinde \u201cAyn\u0131 perdede tart\u0131mla vur\u201d se\xe7; her nota kendi s\xfcresinde ayn\u0131 perdede tart\u0131m\u0131n ritmiyle tekrar vurulur (d\xf6rtl\xfck Re, Ankara ile: Re Re Re). \u201cYaz\u0131lan\u0131 sazla \xe7al\u201d da \xf6yle \xe7alar.")
B.brE=new A.D("0.15.1","Tart\u0131mlar ders videosundaki gibi: Van, \u0130zmir, Ankara, Karaman, Gelibolu, Terazi, Ni\u011fde, Hatay. Her birinin ritmi, hecesi ve tezenesi (bo\u015f vuru\u015flar parantezde) g\xf6sterilir. Tezene kural\u0131: vuru\u015f ba\u015f\u0131 ve sekizlik \u2193, ara onalt\u0131l\u0131k \u2191.")
B.bsf=new A.D("0.15.0","Tart\u0131m: D\xfczenle\u2019de \u201cTart\u0131m\u201da bas, bir kal\u0131p se\xe7 (sekizlikler, sekizlik + iki onalt\u0131l\u0131k \u2026); tezene oklar\u0131 t\xfcm par\xe7aya ya da se\xe7ti\u011fin yere otomatik konur. \u0130stersen notalar\u0131n s\xfcreleri de tart\u0131ma uyar. D\xfczenle\u2019de art\u0131k Kaydet ve \u201cD\xfczenlemeden \xe7\u0131k\u201d var; kaydetmeden \xe7\u0131karken sorar.")
B.btc=new A.D("0.14.0","Porte \xfczerinde d\xfczenleme (MuseScore gibi): D\xfczenle\u2019de notaya dokun, alttaki \xe7ubukla \xf6nceki/sonraki notaya ge\xe7, yar\u0131m ses tizle/pesle, tezene okunu koy/kald\u0131r, \xf6ncesine ya da sonras\u0131na nota ekle, sil.")
B.bsU=new A.D("0.13.1","Ger\xe7ek saz sesi: \u201cYaz\u0131lan\u0131 sazla \xe7al\u201d art\u0131k senin saz\u0131ndan kaydedilen her perdenin kendi sesiyle \xe7alar (La\u2019dan bir \xfcst La\u2019ya, ara perdeler dahil).")
B.bsQ=new A.D("0.13.0","Tekrar i\u015faretleri (\ud834\udd06 \ud834\udd07): k\xe2\u011f\u0131ttaki tekrar i\u015faretleri foto\u011fraftan ya da MusicXML\u2019den okunur, portede g\xf6sterilir; \u201cYaz\u0131lan\u0131 sazla \xe7al\u201d tekrarl\u0131 b\xf6l\xfcm\xfc iki kez \xe7alar.")
B.btH=new A.D("0.12.0","Tezene oklar\u0131: notan\u0131n \xfcst\xfcnde \u2193 a\u015fa\u011f\u0131, \u2191 yukar\u0131 vuru\u015f. Foto\u011fraftaki oklar okunur; D\xfczenle\u2019de her notan\u0131n tezenesini se\xe7ebilirsin. Sat\u0131rlar as\u0131l gibiyken porte ekrana s\u0131\u011facak kadar k\xfc\xe7\xfcl\xfcr.")
B.bt_=new A.D("0.11.1","Haz\u0131r notada makam\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirince notalar da yeni donan\u0131ma uyabilir (\xf6r. foto\u011fraftan Si\u266d okunan Si\u266d2\u2019ler tek seferde). Sat\u0131r ba\u015f\u0131nda okunamayan donan\u0131m d\xfczeltildi.")
B.btY=new A.D("0.11.0","D\xfczenle\u2019de s\xfcre: notay\u0131 onalt\u0131l\u0131k, sekizlik, d\xf6rtl\xfck, ikilik\u2026 yap. Haz\u0131r notada sat\u0131rlar as\u0131ldaki gibi kal\u0131r, uzun notalar ba\u011fla yaz\u0131l\u0131r, birlikte vurulan teller (akor) foto\u011fraftan daha iyi okunur.")
B.bsp=new A.D("0.10.0","Haz\u0131r Nota Y\xfckle: nota adlar\u0131n\u0131 yaz, MuseScore/MusicXML ya da MIDI dosyas\u0131 a\xe7, ya da nota foto\u011fraf\u0131/PDF y\xfckle; sonra D\xfczenle ile d\xfczelt.")
