B.bs1=new A.D("Tezene oklar\u0131","K\xe2\u011f\u0131ttaki notan\u0131n \xfcst\xfcndeki \u2193 \u2191 oklar foto\u011fraftan okunur ve ayn\u0131 yerde g\xf6sterilir (\u201cTezene oklar\u0131\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesi). D\xfczenle\u2019de bir notaya dokunup \u201cTezene: \u2193 A\u015fa\u011f\u0131 / \u2191 Yukar\u0131 / Yok\u201d ile de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsin. MusicXML\u2019e aktar\u0131nca da yaz\u0131l\u0131r.")
